  "description": "Glass replacement of the front and side elevation historical windows of all units within 17-23 and 25-31, replacement of the non-historic windows&nbsp;of all units within&nbsp;17-23 and 25-31, replacements of non-original doors to Flats 17A, 25A, 31A and 31B with timber insulated doors alongside installation of PV panels, ventilation upgrades, and roof / loft insulations within Flats 17A-D; 21A-C-D; 23B-C-D; 25A-D; 29A-B-C; 31A-B.",
